~ beach
if not dev_island_unlocker.is_satisfied():
	=> beach_dev_island_intro

Ty TinkerTear: Tell me about Dev Archipelago!
- I haven't been there yet.
	=> beach_go_to_dev_island
- I didn't know sheep could do that!
	% Ty TinkerTear: Maybe my mum was telling the truth about the annual ovine volleyball competition.
	% Ty TinkerTear: We all have hidden talents.
	=> END
- Can you close the path again?
	Ty TinkerTear: I'll do my best.
	do wait(0.5)
	set GameState.global.facts.dev_island_unlocked = false
	# TODO: no change notification for facts :(
	do dev_island_unlocker.refresh()
	do wait(3.5)
	Ty TinkerTear: Talk to me again if you change your mind.
	=> END

~ beach_dev_island_intro
Ty TinkerTear: My mother used to tell me about the people who created this world.
Ty TinkerTear: I think she called them “Threadbare contributors”.
Ty TinkerTear: She said they’re still out there, even if I can’t see them... and that they always welcomed newcomers.
Ty TinkerTear: Supposedly, they created a special area for themselves, as a playground to try out new things.
Ty TinkerTear: It was called “Dev Archipelago”.
Ty TinkerTear: Do you want to see it for yourself?
- Yes, I'm ready!
	Ty TinkerTear: That's the spirit!
	do wait(0.5)
	set GameState.global.facts.dev_island_unlocked = true
	# TODO: no change notification for facts :(
	do dev_island_unlocker.refresh()
	do wait(3.5)
	Ty TinkerTear: Wow, how did that bridge fix itself?
	=> beach_go_to_dev_island
- Not right now...
	Ty TinkerTear: OK! There are lots of other places to explore.
	Ty TinkerTear: Talk to me again if you change your mind.
	=> END

~ beach_go_to_dev_island
Ty TinkerTear: Go on! Go across the bridge to Dev Archipelago.
=> END
